You are tasked with developing a program that can accurately validate phone numbers in various formats. The program should be able to recognize and validate phone numbers in the following formats: (1) +1-(444)-234-5678, (2) 444.234.5678, (3) 444-234-5678, and (4) (444) 234-5678. Additionally, the program should be able to handle international phone numbers in the format +[country code]-[area code]-[phone number]. The program should also check for valid area codes and phone number lengths for each recognized format. Output 1 if the input string is a valid phone number and 0 if it is invalid.
